15 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (The image is a two-column chart comparing challenges and emerging opportunities in CAR-T cell therapy. The \215Challenges\216 column lists issues such as target dilemmas, multiple barriers in the tumor microenvironment \(TME\), and intrinsic limitations with safety concerns like severe T-cell exhaustion. The \215Emerging Opportunities\216 column describes innovations in CAR engineering, potentiation against TME, optimized delivery strategies, safety enhancements, and personalized treatment systems through approaches like multi-targeting systems, tumor-specific adaptations, and precision monitoring.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
